{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_16_level_main_16-03_beg","groupId":"main_16","stageId":"main_16-02","title":"道路以目","storyCode":"16-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_16-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d5b9b9b60e19b0c2f7fbbabfce46896c2885d48991f1f72f72399860d32195fe","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescom"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>罗德岛新基地，会议室</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于石棺的线索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们目前掌握的石棺的最后动向，是乌萨斯官方在切尔诺伯格-龙门事件之后，回收了全套石棺系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于他们后续到底准备如何运用石棺，似乎是保密更为严格的项目，凯尔希的情报里也完全没有记录。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们可没办法直接向乌萨斯官方申请借用石棺......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们还有什么可以锁定石棺位置的方法？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年切尔诺伯格研究所被破坏之后，从官方的名单上来看，除了那位谢尔盖，整个研究所没有其他幸存者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是通过研究谢尔盖的后续经历，我们可以发现些许线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，谢尔盖又成立了全新的研究石棺的研究所。就在这个研究所短暂运行的那段时间里，我们发现了一个特殊的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿尔乔姆·恰达耶夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人在谢尔盖的研究所里担任副所长，但是他过往的履历却一片空白，没有任何可信的学术和政治背景。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许我们可以合理推断......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这个人和谢尔盖有特殊的关系？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这个人和研究所有特殊的关系？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是哪一种情况，这个人都有可能是突破口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要找的，就是这位阿尔乔姆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，情况还要更复杂一点......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢尔盖的研究所关闭之后，这个人的去向也很难追踪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而根据凯尔希的私人情报，去年冬天，阿尔乔姆在圣骏堡皇家疗养院去世了，死于心脏衰竭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他到最后都和乌萨斯保持着不错的关系。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"或许我们可以调查与他相关的人。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聪明的判断！我也是这样想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我们要找的，是与这位阿尔乔姆有关的另一位研究员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科谢尼娅·马尔科芙娜·涅留朵娃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相比之下，这位研究员的履历要详细得多。在石棺事件发生前，她曾短暂地作为伊利亚的副手在切城研究所工作过，与凯尔希打过交道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据我们了解到的最新消息，目前，她正在乌萨斯远北地区，布列斯克下辖的远北中心矿区研究所里工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而那里，正是阿尔乔姆临终前寄出的最后几封信件的收件地址。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"听上去并不是一个十分可靠的线索......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"却也是我们唯一的线索。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们应该去那座研究所找她。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我必须要提醒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们已经下定决心要把凯尔希带回来，但我们必须考量每一次任务的风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"华法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛现在经不起多少损失了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"可是......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯至今依然是非常危险的地方，并且，这次任务我们掌握的情报十分有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而罗德岛重建工作刚刚起步，很多事务还需要博士和阿米娅参与决策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Raidian，我可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，阿米娅已经是很厉害的大人了，但正因为这样，留守罗德岛这项最重要的任务要交给阿米娅才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰传回的消息同样令人不安，博士势必要去处理。让罗德岛在新家园站稳脚跟，是我们当下最要紧的任务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说得对......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果只是潜入任务，那肯定是Misery的小队更加擅长，但还要收集情报的话，还是我的小队更为专精。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况，回乌萨斯行动的话，也没有比我更合适的人选了，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听上去，Raidian的分析还是很有道理的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你决定吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这次任务很危险。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一定要注意安全，Raidian。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛不能再失去任何人了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦，我们会以流动医疗队的形式谨慎行动的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不在的时候，大家都要照顾好自己哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望每一个人，都能平安回家......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“......我愿意默想，并分担他的痛苦。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“一个人的痛苦是每个人的痛苦，一个人的罪过是每个人的罪过......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苍老的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“愿有罪的人都能诚心忏悔，其罪过都可被原谅，其灵魂都可被救赎......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g4_miningarea_polluted"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北中心矿区</><p=2>五天前</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的嚎叫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"痛苦的嚎叫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的......奶奶，您，别害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，雷尔金，老师......他已经把，追过来的纠察队，都赶走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们，暂时安全了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......暂时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还能往哪去呢，我们该上哪去寻求安宁呢......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奶奶......您、您饿了吗......？我去问问霍里，再要一块面包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事......乖孩子，我没事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看雷尔金吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他做了最多的事，他的心灵也会变得千疮百孔的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年迈的老妇","speakerId":"avg_npc_1964_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看他吧，不要让他再背负更多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，他......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"narration","text":"昏暗的天幕下，青年肃杀的面容趋于平静。\n阵雪很快消弭了矿镐上热血的温度，眼前畏缩的敌人已全然溃退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别......别杀我！你们不能动我，我已经投降了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们还没有接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉我，像你们这样的追兵，还有多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天杀的，我不——我不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每一支纠察队都是独立的，相互之间没什么联系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再告诉我一点我不知道的事，不然我没有让你活着的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别，别动手！听我说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们身上的芯片！检测芯片！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"青年矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芯片？你是说检测感染程度的芯片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈......哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“高尚的雷尔金”“英雄的雷尔金”，你真的这么天真？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们身上的芯片，会把坐标位置传回矿区研究所和最近的卫兵哨所，在你们私自离开矿区，或者芯片从身体里脱离的一瞬间——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“砰”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"炸掉一条腿算便宜的，两条腿也不是没可能，毕竟这样你们就哪儿也去不了了，哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，你放弃吧......你们以为杀了一支纠察队，就可以逃出这片矿场了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们哪都去不了......乌萨斯会永远追杀你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"投降吧，这是保证你们不至于死得太悲惨的唯一办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，别听他张嘴就来！芯片要是会爆炸，早就有驮兽因为芯片缺胳膊缺腿了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"纠察队都是畜生不如的东西，他们嘴里的真话就跟冬天的蚜虫一样少！我还没变成感染者的时候就见多了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，你今天已经做得够多了，让我来杀了他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不要！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再、再——杀人了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......没事！没、没有人，重伤......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"少年矿工","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先放开他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“小枝条”，你让开！你干什么为这东西求情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宝丽娜就是被这帮畜生逼死的，不过是因为她庇护了一个没登记的孩子......她被吊死的时候还怀着孕呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们做过多少丧良心的事，你都忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小枝条”","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，咳、咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，谢谢你，“小枝条”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的纠察队队员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你......你是最温顺的孩子，你会有一个好下场的，就算他们所有人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小枝条”","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少我没让他在雪地里失血而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站稳了，别乔克。到后面去，去帮我把那位医生找来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保尔，你去找尼克托，告诉他，让所有想离开矿区的人都集中到南宿舍区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让大家做好准备，我们身上的芯片必须拆除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真信那家伙说的话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，我们都必须先拆掉芯片。就算爆炸是假的，定位也是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经有纠察队找上来了，我们还无法确定下一波是什么时候，这样下去我们会非常被动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"激动的矿工","speakerId":"avg_npc_1969_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......我听你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，您、您答应......答应过，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你还在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没答应过你任何事，别乔克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果其他纠察队的畜生都死了，他究竟凭什么例外？凭他的傲慢，凭他的讥诮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，你不懂。忘了我刚才说的话吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你把这个拿着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个秒表，我在研究所里找到的，应该还能用。之后有空了，我教你认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以后，你不用再数着没有意义的数字过活，担心数漏一个就有人死在矿井下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于现在......去吧，别乔克。去帮我把人找来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，您的手，在抖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了。去做你该做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，至少，让我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愿您的......灵魂......得到......拯救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你看见那些人怎么对待我们，也看见我是怎么要了他们的命？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要轻易祝福，更不要轻易宽恕，别乔克。即使是对我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快去吧，我们没有时间了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......雷尔金先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，塞拉菲娜女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们认识的时间不长，但我愿意相信，既然你的医疗小队愿意来到这片偏远的地方帮助治疗感染者，你们一定是可以托付信任的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，我现在不得不拜托你一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请说吧，只要是我能帮得上的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才得知，这里的每一位矿工，体内都存在一枚随时可能爆炸的定位芯片。为了摆脱纠察队的追捕，我们必须想办法把芯片取出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我准备从自己开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我成功了，请你协助我帮其他人进行手术；如果它不幸爆炸了，请你对我实施急救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我因此死了......也请你把这件事告诉其他还在等着我的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，请你先离开这里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，先让我检查一下，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很不幸，芯片可能会爆炸的说法是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你体内的芯片的确携带了微型的烈性源石炸药，一旦芯片无法接收到矿区内或人体内的电信号，就会触发爆炸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大家想要从这片矿区撤离，拆除芯片恐怕是必要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"厉害。你的源石技艺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许，我可以暂时操控相同的电信号骗过芯片的信号接收器。但我必须提醒你，这样做依然有很大的风险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总不能等到每件事都万无一失再行动......有你这个办法就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Raidian开始用源石技艺，使能量束以相同频率与芯片中的信号接收器共振。\n雷尔金点头，坐下来攥住刀柄，感受冰凉、光滑、坚硬，使它与掌心的茧相碰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"医生，你最好还是离我更远一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了。这是第一次尝试，我必须实时监控情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以通过神经电信号引导你手臂的动作，要小心，不要破坏芯片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"了不起......我有点遗憾没能早些认识你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......希望我们还有交谈的机会吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"雷尔金在匕首上倒了些酒，用刀刃对准腿上的疤痕，将其嵌入血肉里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......成功了，对吧？"},{"type":"narration","text":"青年矿工几乎要一跃而起，甚至忘记了自己鲜血淋漓的伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请先冷静点，你的伤口需要包扎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，当然，谢谢你医生，我欠了你一条命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很厉害，我从来没有见过像你这样厉害的医生，你甚至让我想起了乌萨斯的军人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不理解你的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，请不要误会，这是我能想到的最高尚的赞誉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说，那些真正的乌萨斯军人——与那些纠察队的畜生不同，他们赶走了入侵的梦魇，推翻了骏鹰的暴政，是真正的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，伊戈尔大帝的传记，你读过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该继续准备其他人的手术了——总共有多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......恐怕是会让你和你的同伴有些劳累的数量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我操控的电信号能完全覆盖这一片区域，我的同伴们可以协同进行手术。这样的话，我估计我们需要在这里停留一段时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的时间紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医疗小队优先去帮助老人和孩子，然后教其他人该怎样做。把手术刀发给他们吧，我的同伴们从来不软弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金先生，请你不要代替医生做决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不，医生，我并不是想指挥你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然我已经担起了带领大家逃出这片矿区的责任，那我就需要做出相应的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随时可能追上来的纠察队，还有恶劣的天气、紧缺的物资——都是要命的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望我们可以达成共识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无论如何，都要谨防感染。我的小队会监督大家做好消毒工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我们开始吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“先动起来，再谈将来。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g3_miningarea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呕——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳！呕......咳——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就受不了了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之前在圣骏堡吃熏肉肠的时候，是不是从来没有想过它们是怎样做出来的？或者你有没有去看过卫星城里的屠宰场？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去你的！*乌萨斯粗口*，雷尔金，你真该死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吞了一肚子雪也盖不住鼻腔里的血腥味——下次我一定找机会在你的汤里掺最新鲜的驮兽血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新鲜的驮兽血很贵，一桶要卖到一百多切尔文，我们现在买不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该死，我就是打个比方......霍里，我都不知道你还当过高级餐厅的厨师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我儿子在当卡车司机的时候运过这种东西，圣骏堡的贵族们相信驮兽幼崽的血可以用来美容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他在信里给我讲过很多圣骏堡的事，但上一次来信已经是七年前了。希望他过得还好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我要拜托你小心点了，别让尼克托对我的晚餐动手脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍里","speakerId":"avg_npc_1971_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会小心的。没有人可以对大家的晚餐动手脚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希望这不会是我们吃的最后一顿晚饭，不然我一定会诅咒你的，雷尔金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随你怎么说，今天我的心情很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我很久没有觉得像这样自由过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们终于卸下了镣铐，我们是自由的。我们想做的事、想去的地方、我们的生活，都只由我们自己决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你大可以找个更安定的时候再吟诗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，我们接下来该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的计划没有变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去南边，去乌卡边境，找到那个由感染者建立，也只属于感染者的农庄。那里会有我们所有人的容身之处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是愿意无理由地相信那个不知真假的“整合运动”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我当然有理由相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前些年我还在乌卡边境值守的时候，听到过许多关于他们的可信消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们收容感染者，免费分发药物，还把许多想要欺凌感染者的纠察队打得落荒而逃——我相信有人和我们的理想是一致的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只会怀疑这是感染者自欺欺人的幻想，或者是军队编出来索要税收的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只会好奇，像这样的旗帜为什么直到现在才被举起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果我们发现他们不存在，就该由我们举起这面旗帜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......我原本以为在边境的军旅生涯会让你长些别的教训。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想象一下，要是当年你救的是那位伯爵大人，而不是那个感染者，你现在恐怕已经是中尉，甚至是上尉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像我们今天遇上的纠察队，只要你勾勾手指，他们就会爬过来亲吻你的靴子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我很感激我做出的选择，否则我不会有机会看清这个国家的真实面貌，也不会认识到自己这一生最重要的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的人民已经在愚弄和蒙蔽下活了太久，他们认为自己眼前的生活就是理所应当的，完全忘了自己应得的是什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不只是感染者和普通人的矛盾，假如有一天乌萨斯的感染者都死绝了，他们也会按另一套标准把一部分人送到矿场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凭什么有些人生来就能拥有一切，另外一些人一辈子只能苟且求生？他们辛苦劳动取得的成果到底供养了谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是说到底，又是谁规定了什么是“应得”的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许这片大地现在的样貌就是真理，假使存在另外一个泰拉，假使文明进程推倒重来一万遍，也跳不出这套结构。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我不相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当你睁眼看到发生在我们周围的一切时，你难道不会愤怒吗？当我们本能地感到愤怒的时候，那便说明这一切是错误的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托，以你的经历，你应该明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别提那些陈年旧事了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得了......就算像你说的那样，我们现在离边境还有多远？这一路上我们还会遇到多少事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经有了一个计划——你以为我为什么要让你收集这些芯片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然它们不像其他的芯片那样，摘出来就爆炸了，但这也意味着它们的定位功能还没有消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，这些东西让我们吃了不少苦头，那我们为什么不利用它们反将纠察队一军呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这和我们决定逃出去前说的不一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，你应该清楚大家的状态。现在还能动弹的人有多少？有原先的一半吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们能击败这些纠察队一次两次，但我们不可能对抗整个乌萨斯！制造更多的流血冲突只会让我们陷入完全的被动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们想要活下去，走到这一步就只是时间问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多杀一个纠察队的走卒，我们手中就至少能多一个备用的呼吸器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夺来的物资能帮助我们走出冰原，也能帮别乔克那样的孩子多活些时日。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我们能离开的契机是什么，你难道忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使那东西都算不上是个人，也是我们一起让它没了命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道你在说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们甚至还没走出矿区，你就已经变得完全不可理喻了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尼克托，我不愿意吵架——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老，老师......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，尼克托先生，您，也在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没事。我只是来看看，老师有没有吃饭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那你可以少操一份心了，他的肚子已经被他宏伟的理想填饱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......他说得也不算错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多关注一下那几位医生朋友吧，今天最辛苦的是他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚，去看过他们了。他们，都准备，休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，你也辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伤口怎么样，还疼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......还好。大家，都一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我们每个人都很勇敢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去休息吧，去填饱肚子，然后好好睡一觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我们，食物有限，我的饭量，不大......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"别乔克","speakerId":"avg_4207_branch_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，您也要，注意身体......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷尔金，“小枝条”很信任你，她一直把你当作老师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大家都是信任你的，他们都在等着你带他们走出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，所以我告诉她的每一句话，都是我发自内心认同的真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也在带领大家走向我认为正确的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放轻松点，尼克托。今天是我们取得第一场胜利的日子，是一个好兆头，没必要这样愁眉苦脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当一个人因觉醒而决定出发的时候，就是一个伟大的开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼克托","speakerId":"avg_npc_1967_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是《伊戈尔传》里说的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是我自己说的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷尔金","speakerId":"avg_npc_1963_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，尼克托，我们在做一件伟大的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g10_tent_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"队长，所有人的手术都已经做完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"条件实在有限，有些人开始发烧了，实在没办法避免......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，之后我会去和他们的领袖协商，尽可能保障伤员的食物和水的供应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天你们都辛苦了，尽快休息，也要保证自己的健康。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我们接下来还要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今远北全面戒严，天气也会影响通讯状况，我们很难与外界取得联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里发生的事一定会引来乌萨斯的注意，我们不能留下，必须尽快离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我们确定要与他们一起行动吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛医疗干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，我很担心，这样下去我们会面临与乌萨斯对立的局面......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，罗德岛没有立场与乌萨斯为敌，但是此时此刻在这里的，也只是许多想要活下去的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"改变感染者的处境，这始终是罗德岛的志向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，这段时间我们也接受过他们不少帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先不用担心了，尽可能做好应对意外事件的准备，我会继续尝试与城中据点取得联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Raidian","speakerId":"avg_npc_1730_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他们可以接收到我们之前发出的消息......希望他们前来支援时，也能发现我们留下的线索吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"66_g1_bleskstreet"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>乌萨斯远北地区，布列斯克</><p=2>三天前</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的报童","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卖报——《布列斯克时报》——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的报童","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......要来一份报纸吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好、好的......多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的报童","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"二十帕拉......可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我好像没有零钱了......这个给你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的报童","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢姐姐！你真是好人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅小心翼翼地将一枚一切尔文的硬币放在孩子的手心里，拿到钱的孩子好像生怕对方后悔一样，一溜烟地消失在街角。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你在看什么？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个孩子身上的衣服......好薄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布列斯克，比我印象里的乌萨斯，还要冷一点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"上一次来乌萨斯的时候是冬天。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"布列斯克比切尔诺伯格还要更靠北。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得那个时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我第一次见到那样激烈的战场，甚至紧张得忘了害怕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时以为，再也不会有比那更危险的时刻了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"结果在那之后，我们又经历了很多。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"至少现在没有天灾和追兵。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"至少现在我很清楚地知道自己是谁。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，说起来，我们好像很少有机会像这样静静地观察一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是切尔诺伯格、龙门，还是伦蒂尼姆，我们的记忆里好像都充满了动乱和战火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这才是这片大地本该有的样子。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们应该记住这座城市现在的样子。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看看今天的报纸吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"上面有报道矿区封锁的原因吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许只有等阿洛伊泽小姐和那位女大公进行交涉后，才能知道更多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说会为我们申请进入矿区的许可，可是，她到底会怎么做呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她有意让我们意识到我们掌握的消息十分有限。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她想让我们处于被动的局面。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面就是女大公的办公地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从我们之前收集到的信息来看，这位女大公名叫叶莉萨维塔·康斯坦丁诺夫娜·拉齐萨拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和许多人印象中的乌萨斯贵族不同，这位女大公治理辖地的政策是以“仁慈”出名——不论是对普通人还是对感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从各个渠道打听到的消息里都提到了她的好名声。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"有这样的好名声，只是“仁慈”是不够的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这位女大公应该也是个足够聪明的人。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她的办公场所似乎不算宏伟。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"看上去像是民居。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布列斯克的建筑普遍比较低矮与规整，可能是乌萨斯远北特有的风格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，从地图上看，周边建筑都呈现出拱卫这栋楼的趋势，至少从城市规划角度来说，它确实有着相对独特的地理位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以，我们还是在这里了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这次甚至没让我们进去等。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"一位雷厉风行的年轻女士。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"一位颇有声望的地区领导者。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你在担心吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我也是。即使阿洛伊泽小姐表明了态度，她的真实目的也并不清晰——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（摇头）","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不觉得现在的情况很熟悉吗？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊。你是在说龙门那次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陈小姐的确算得上是雷厉风行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"难道不是“很难应付”了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我们把它当成“严格”的另一种说法吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这点上，陈小姐无论对人对己都是一样的，不管是那时，还是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了！其实在出发前，我们还收到过陈小姐的消息。虽然她没有说自己的具体动向，但至少听上去状态还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她听说了之前发生的事，承诺如果罗德岛需要，她就会回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们结识了许多朋友。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"也有许多人离开了我们。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，和陈小姐一起行动的时候，代表罗德岛与魏长官交涉的，其实是凯尔希医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我还是会担心，自己做不到像凯尔希医生那样处理问题，或者促成与他人的合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我们对乌萨斯如今的情况、对这位女大公，都知之甚少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们没必要去做只有凯尔希才能做到的事。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就做你自己吧，阿米娅。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们会有办法的。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远北卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问，哪一位是罗德岛的Dr.{@nickname}？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"远北卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1972_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女大公殿下有请。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
